I'll create a faithful reproduction of the classic 1978 Taito arcade game with all the rules, sprites, and mechanics intact.

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>1978 Taito Arcade - Space Invaders</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        body {
            background: #000;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
        }
        #gameContainer {
            width: 800px;
            height: 900px;
            background: #111;
            position: relative;
            border: 4px solid #000;
            box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        }
        canvas {
            display: block;
            margin: 20px auto;
            background: #000;
            width: 760px;
            height: 860px;
            image-rendering: pixelated;
        }
        #info {
            position: absolute;
            top: 10px;
            left: 20px;
            color: #0f0;
            font-size: 14px;
            text-shadow: 0 0 5px #0f0;
        }
        #info span {
            margin-right: 20px;
        }
        #gameOver {
            position: absolute;
            top: 40%;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
            color: #f0f;
            font-size: 36px;
            text-shadow: 0 0 20px #f0f;
            display: none;
            font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
        }
        #restartBtn {
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 30px;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            background: #333;
            color: #0f0;
            border: 2px solid #0f0;
            padding: 8px 20px;
            font-size: 16px;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
        }
        #restartBtn:hover {
            background: #0f0;
            color: #000;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
